# Netlify routing for the public site (myspaza-app.co.za).
#
# The sandbox preview gets both of these from the Vite dev server (SPA fallback
# plus the /api proxy). A static deploy has neither, so they are declared here,
# in the publish directory, where Netlify reads them.

# The app's own endpoints run as a function that shares the sandbox email
# service's handlers (server/): invitations, the Supabase Send-Email hook and
# the Resend delivery webhook.
/api/*  /.netlify/functions/api/:splat  200

# Single-page app: every other path serves index.html so a deep link, a
# password-reset link or an invitation link (/invite/<token>) loads the app
# instead of Netlify's 404 page. Rules apply only when no real file matches.
/*  /index.html  200
